Report operator/runtime API configuration, workload ClusterIssuer readiness, CA expiry and fingerprints, and whether the selected server route requests client certificates. Secret private keys and credentials are never read or printed.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster identity status [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help            help for status
      --server string   Selected MCPServer as <namespace>/<name>

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
